        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage F-Series Avila Door Lever Set</b>\r\n<p>The modern design and striking angular lines of the Elan Lever enhances both contemporary and modern homes. It will fits standard door cutouts and has an adjustable backset. Available 3 finishes.</p>\r\n<p>\r\nWhen you install Schlage lever, you safeguard your home and family as well as your peace of mind. Schlage levers will never tarnish, discolor, or corrode. Plus, the wide variety of finishes may make your decision tough--just like this lever.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Avila Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adjustable Backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>One Piece Lever for Better Security and Appearance</li>\r\n<li>Fits Standard Pre-drilled Doors</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.2 Series 4000 Grade 2</li>\r\n<li>Pressure-cast Zinc Tubular Lock Housing</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty on Residential Applications</li>\r\n<li>Solid Brass Lever and Trim Rose</li>\r\n<li>Available in 5 Finishes</li>\r\n<li>Sold as Complete Set</li>\r\n<li>Easy to Install</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Single Dummy: For use as a pull or to match trim on one side of the door. It does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li>Passage (Hall or Closet): For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock.</li>\r\n<li>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom): For doors that could need locking. The lock is activated by a push button in the center of the lever while turning the inside lever releases the lock. It can be opened from the outside with a small circular tool.</li>\r\n<li>Keyed Entry (Keyed Lock): Use when a lock operated by a key is needed. Unlocked by key from the outside when outer lever is locked by turn-button in the middle of the inside lever. Inside lever unlocked by turn button.</li>\r\n<li>Storeroom Lock (Keyed Entry Only): Use when entry by a key is needed. Always locked, entry from the outside requires a key. The inside lever is always unlocked. The outside lever is fixed.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Avila Door Lever, Schlage F-VLA",
                "description": "Avila Door Leverset, Schlage F-VLA - The timeless nature of the Avila's design allows this Schlage made leverset to blend seamlessly into almost any decor It is easy to install with an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch; plus it is adjustable for 1-3/8 inch up to 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses. Once it is installed, the classic design is sure to stand up to the trials or time and the ever-changing fashion fads. Available in 5 finishes.",
